+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,6 +2,18 @@

 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.

+The five main sections share `SectionLayout.astro`. Each view is rendered once
+on entry; section navigation toggles `hidden` on the existing DOM nodes, keeping
+hydrated islands and local state mounted. This trades a larger initial document
+for section switches with no requests or DOM reconstruction. Direct section URLs
+also work without JavaScript. Other destinations use normal page navigation.
+
+Navigation regression checks (Node 24+):
+
+```sh
+node --test tests/section-navigation.test.mjs
+```
+

