+# Homepage media
+
+Stock video from Mixkit, available under the Mixkit Stock Video Free License:
+
+- `morning-coffee.mp4`: https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/filling-a-white-cup-of-coffee-236/
+- `roasting.mp4`: https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/coffee-roaster-in-operation-88001/
+- License: https://mixkit.co/license/#videoFree
+
+Both videos are silent. Posters are frames extracted from the corresponding clips.
+The MP4s are resized to 960×540 with H.264 and fast-start metadata.
+
+`finding-your-roast.mp3` is original coffee education copy narrated with FFmpeg's
+Flite `slt` voice. The exact spoken copy is in the homepage transcript.
+
+The hero is intentionally eager. Below-the-fold players use native media lazy
+loading when supported and an IntersectionObserver (200px margin) otherwise.
+Their URLs start in data attributes to prevent HTML scanning from fetching posters
+or media before the script can select a loading strategy. No media is autoplayed.
+With JavaScript disabled, direct links provide playback without background downloads.
