+permissions, tolerates browsers that do not recognize these permission names,
+and declares the corresponding `targetAddressSpace` on each fetch. Unsupported
+browsers may still block HTTP endpoints as mixed content; use a browser supporting
+Local Network Access or trusted HTTPS endpoints. Endpoint CORS support is always
+required. If deployment adds CSP, its `connect-src` must permit the intended local
+endpoints; any Permissions-Policy must allow `local-network` and
