+## Phone verification during sign-up
+
+The sign-up form sends SMS codes through the server route
+`/devtools-times/api/signup/verify`. Set `TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID`,
+`TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN`, and `TWILIO_VERIFY_SERVICE_SID` in the server environment
